    "question": {
      ":question/id": "dfa3945a-76db-53b4-915b-6bbe63a72ed8",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y = \\tan x$? Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function has asymptotes at $x = \\frac{π}{2} + πn$.\n- **II.** The range of the function is $y ∈ (-\\frac{\\pi }{4}, \\frac{\\pi }{4})$.\n- **III.** The domain of the function is all real numbers except $x = nπ$.",
