    "question": {
      ":question/id": "1979d94c-6a1e-5da1-b1fe-e48461d80ab5",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ represents any integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The vertical asymptotes of the function are $x=n\\pi $\n- **II.** Its graph passes through the point $(0,0)$\n- **III.** $\\tan (x-\\frac{\\pi }{3})=\\tan (x+\\frac{2\\pi }{3})$\n\nIn tangent equalities, consider values of $x$ where both sides are defined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "a76cf1e9-6c92-5aa6-b34d-c188016efff7",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
