      "title": "Describing Properties of the Tangent Function"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9c6e8448-a044-555d-b8e9-580b35f2ad38",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function has asymptotes at $x=3n\\pi .$\n- **II.** The function returns only positive values on the intervals $(\\pi n,\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi n)\\,.$\n- **III.** The function has zeros at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "7a07cd0c-7096-5e36-9213-7c941c49c384",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1094c335-04c3-5b8f-bed3-958a0a439d79",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "6480c694-e5e4-589d-a0d4-e85c8336e77c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "1094c335-04c3-5b8f-bed3-958a0a439d79"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "a98619b9-0c09-57bc-a6ea-64475c467c39",
          ":answer-field/key": "II",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "cc16897c-33ff-520f-9a4c-6fb7a4aa4c3c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "dfac4a12-d99f-5f96-8877-4055f9b68b99",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
