    "question": {
      ":question/id": "eba1ea47-e35b-5907-af8d-fe631893ca9a",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ represents any integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\tan (x+\\pi )=\\tan (x+n\\pi ).$\n- **II.** The function has asymptotes at $x=n\\pi $\n- **III.** $\\tan (x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})=\\tan (x+\\frac{3\\pi }{4}).$\n\nIn tangent equalities, consider values of $x$ where both sides are defined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "f8c037b4-d08e-5f88-ab12-01e7da7655ff",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1859c895-2063-5531-abb8-54201feba0dd",
