    "question": {
      ":question/id": "544fcca9-4056-5b6f-a64a-10582d8e778e",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function has asymptotes at $x=2n\\pi .$\n- **II.** The function returns only positive values on the intervals $(\\pi n,\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi n)\\,.$\n- **III.** The function has zeros at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi .$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "6f8c5d01-abde-590d-a2af-af2d5d902b04",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "3f06a416-b72f-5f11-8774-d85f31db31c5",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "70da2e56-a401-5c86-84f2-646f1d578086",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
