    "question": {
      ":question/id": "35250f6f-ed16-5f3c-b6f0-9d0a417501b7",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The domain of the function is all real numbers except $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi $\n\n- **II.** The function has zeros at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi $ for any integer $n$\n\n- **III.** The range of the function is $y\\in (-\\frac{\\pi }{4},\\frac{\\pi }{4})$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "046815ff-cd36-56e9-83d2-61c2deb0daa1",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "b6e47164-7fc0-5c32-9981-c3d66ec5af84",
